assets/images/wedding_photos/

# Internal SEO briefing: local-only, never published
seo-report/

# CI scratch for responsive image variants (see scripts/make-responsive-variants.sh)
.rsp-cache/

# Proposal system archive: removed from the public repo 2026-07-11, kept local-only
proposal-archive/

# Hero timing tool: an internal instrument for tuning the home hero, not a page
# of the site. Deliberately local-only, so run it with `jekyll serve` and open
# /hero-lab. Ignored rather than merely untracked because the repo is public and
# a stray `git add -A` would put it, and every future edit, in public history.
hero-lab/
